    Frame     animation time at which the model is posed for the collision hull
    Output    <name>.mdl (mdlc -optimize) and <name>.cvh (xmunge + cvh + qhull)

  ArtTextModel: a hand-written text MDL (from copymdl.txt) and the .x files it imports.
    Mode      optimize: mdlc -optimize <Text> <name>; compile: mdlc <Text> <name>.mdl
-->
